<p>Barry and {% person "esther-elizabeth-kubishta-davis" %}Esther Davis{% endperson %} bought the Havana Club and reopened it September 14, 1964. Interested parties, including creditors who wanted the establishment to remain open, approached the couple and helped finance the purchase. Barry Davis had provided musical entertainment at the club for years, and Esther had worked as a food hostess at another local nightclub.</p>

